Z||000000||WhiteFieroBlur||12-27-2001||06:13 AM||||Well this is like the second time I hear my alarm go off and a car speeds off in front of my house. This time I go outside and my antenna is all bend like crap. I dunno what these people are doing to my car. How do I take off the antenna and put on another one? I think I am gonna call the police tomorrow and see if hey will patrol my neighborhood. I can't see why people would be doing this to my car. I dunno what to do its hard to sleep cause I keep thinking someone is gonna do something else to my car.<p>[This message has been edited by WhiteFieroBlur (edited 12-27-2001).]||||reg||8
