Z||000006||ejayerik||12-27-2001||09:07 AM||||I suggest that you invest in a 100 dollar wireless video camera to place inconspicusly inside your car. You can attatch the moniter to your vcr and tape it all night. Anyone that approches your car will be on tape. And since the other end of the wireless camera will be inside your house or apartment taping the whole thing, they can't do anything but look guilty.||||reg||1
Z||000007||Formula88||12-27-2001||09:36 AM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by rogergarrison:<BR><B>take a couple of days off<P>1. sleep day<BR>2. stay awake nite<BR>3. keep loaded rifle by door</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Yup.  That's the ticket.  Shoot out the tires of their car first - so if there's more than one of them, they can't get away.  If you don't want to stay up all night, you might invest in a hidden camera and hook it up to your VCR.  They're dirt cheap these days.  I've thought about that myself.<p>[This message has been edited by Formula88 (edited 12-27-2001).]||||reg||8
Z||000008||Oreif||12-27-2001||10:50 AM||||You can even get 2 camera's and place one in a tree out in front. So when a car pulls up you tape the plate # on the car. Then supply the tape to the Police and sign a complaint of vandalism. If you tape them more than once, I think you can get a restraining order against them. That way it's not a fine but actual jail time.<P><P>------------------<BR>             <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/LOGO3.jpg">           <BR><FONT SIZE="1"><B><I>Happiness isn't around the corner...<BR>Happiness IS the corner.</I></B></FONT>||||reg||1
Z||000009||kneebarx||12-27-2001||11:05 AM||||Cool!  Someone who has the same problem as me!  Well, I mean, no, that sucks.  I had a Pontiac bonneville that some stupid kids kept kicking and denting and scratching.  It pissed me the hell off, and I had no idea why.  Probably some kids from way back when or just some kids that don't like seeing someone with a better car than them.  ANYWAY, one thing I have found that has been working is LIGHT.  For some reason, vandalizers dont like the light.  I have a motion detector light(about 20 bucks from walmart) that turns on whenever someone walks in front of my house(where my car is).  So you go near my car and you WILL be seen.  It is very bright, by the way.  AND if you want to catch them, if they still do it, you will need this light to catch them on camera, b/c the street lights dont let you see crap.  ||||reg||1
Z||000010||tomanyfieros||12-27-2001||02:25 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by rogergarrison:<BR><B><BR>3. keep loaded rifle by door</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>what if u get really crazy when u see the people @ ur fiero and u start shooting and hit the fiero? and what if the car blows up like in the movies? lol... (no flames) <BR>Thanx Jason<BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/dreamer.gif">    <BR><B>We all have dreams, but not everyone gets them...</B>||||reg||1
Z||000011||Butter||12-27-2001||03:38 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by rogergarrison:<BR><B>take a couple of days off<P>1. sleep day<BR>2. stay awake nite<BR>3. keep loaded rifle by door</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>If I's gonna go threw all that, I'd prefer an automatic shotgun loaded with a progresively larger shot size but then that's just me.<P>Last time our neighborhood reported their were theives in it I happened up on a strange car in the wrong place twice in one night.  After I bounced one off the road in front of them they rather quickly loaded up in a cussing fit and speed off.  Somehow that thievin' problem has ceased since then.  My neighbors feel like I do about it cause I talked with them about it. Nuff said!<P>||||reg||11
Z||000012||Oreif||12-27-2001||03:47 PM||||You know all you really need to do is borrow a pump action shotgun and wait. When they come up to the car at night, just chamber a cartridge. The sound of a pump shotgun "KA-Chunk" chambering a shell alone will send a deep chill down their spine and most likely they will soil their pants. You don't even have to be pointing it at them! It is not illegal to chamber a round in a shotgun.<P>||||reg||3
