Z||000019||Posthumane||12-28-2001||02:06 AM||||Or rather than a shotgun, get a rather large hunting knife. Knives make less noise than guns, and the less noise, the more likely one is to use them. If you come out of the house holding a macheddi (sp?) they'll leave your car alone for good. Don't like the paintball idea, it gives legit players a bad name. Whatever the case, make sure you give them a real scare. When I first got my car, I had someone always smearing food all over it when I wasn't looking. I once left my window open a touch because I only stepped inside for a min to get something, and they smeared bannana all over the interior. Took me forever to get it out.<p>[This message has been edited by Posthumane (edited 12-28-2001).]||||reg||1
